OL,3,AUS death row inmate Christa Pike taken
OL,4,Ato hospital after surviving two lethal
OL,5,Ainjections, says lawyer
OL,6,
OL,7,FTennessee death row inmate Christa Pike
OL,8,Fhas been taken to hospital after she
OL,9,Fwas still alive following two lethal
OL,10,Finjections during her execution, her
OL,11,Flawyer says.
OL,13,FHer legal team filed an emergency
OL,14,Fmotion to halt the execution as it was
OL,15,Fhappening, saying: "Ms Pike has lost
OL,16,Fconsciousness and still has a heartbeat
OL,17,Fand is audibly snoring."
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
